WEBVTT

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.307
and your conference call self.

00:17:01.797 --> 00:17:04.628
And I hope it's different
from your drinks-after-work self.

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:08.896
You get to choose which selves
you express in which situations,

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:11.536
and those selves
are evolving all the time

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:13.206
So as you move into new territory,

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.992
it helps to test out different selves

00:17:15.016 --> 00:17:16.916
to see what feels like you.

00:17:16.940 --> 00:17:19.886
That's what Herminia ended up doing
in her own teaching.

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:21.996
She tried out different
provisional selves,

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:23.614
moving around the classroom more

00:17:23.638 --> 00:17:26.436
and engaging students more
in interactive discussions.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:29.826
HI: It changed from being,
"I have content to deliver,"

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:33.679
to, "I'm there to facilitate an experience